            {
                "content": "```\nInput: arr = [2,4,5,10]\nOutput: 7\nExplanation: We can make these trees: [2], [4], [5], [10], [4, 2, 2], [10, 2, 5], [10, 5, 2].\n```"
            }
        ]
    },
